A||||6||72vinman||What was the LIFE magazine cover the week you were born?||||1||
Z||000000||72vinman||12-29-2001||12:40 AM||||This is kinda cool. What was going on when you were born?<BR>July 10, 1972 was about George McGovern. I believe he lost the Presidential election to Nixon and was one of the main Senate opponents of the Vietnam War. I am not really sure, I may need a little help from my American friends on this one.<P>Enter your birthdate and hit enter. <A HREF="http://www.lifemag.com/Life/search/covers" TARGET=_blank>http://www.lifemag.com/Life/search/covers</A> <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigvin2_1.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by 72vinman (edited 12-29-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000001||AusFiero||12-29-2001||01:21 AM||||Vietcong prisoner Paul Schutzer was on the cover of life the week I was born. Good to see I was born in "peace" time  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_dizzy.gif"><P>------------------<BR>          <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero5.gif">         <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.fieroshop.com.au" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||1
