Z||000006||PK||12-29-2001||06:19 AM||||Too young (just!).  I got a similar thing many years ago that tells me what went on when I was born........<P>US astronauts are launched in to space for a planned 59-day mission in Skylab.<P>Birthday shared with Dr W.G Grace (cricketer) , Nick Faldo (golfer), John Glenn Jr (astronaut) and Richard Branson (entrepreneur).<P>The average income was £975 ($1400).  A three bedroom house cost £10,000 ($14,500). A loaf of bread was 12p ($0.17)and petrol was 36p ($0.52)/UK gallon!<P>The top tunes of the time were: You are the sunshine of my life, Love Train, Merry Xmas Everybody, Live and Let Die and Goodbye Yellow Brick Road.<P>Cheers<BR><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sig2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
